lines=['# Interior host survey and first blockout','', 'Original city files are unchanged. Only D is built, to blockout stage, in Nova_City_interiors.blend.','', '## Confirmed inventory','',f"Nova: {len(n['objects'])} city-scene objects. Veyra: {len(v['objects'])} city-scene objects. Both have 110 tower glazing meshes. All shared Tower object bounding boxes match between files.",'','Podium base z=4 is not a universal walkable-ground height. Actual surfaces include terrain z=2, canal avenue z=4.5, promenade and district boulevards z=6, and civic paving z=8. Entry design must use local measurements.','','## Host schedule','', '| Rooms | Host | Measured podium footprint | Status / reason |','|---|---|---|---|']
